	have been meant to key, but the cable was never keyed, so
	its unclear if this is 100% reliable).
c)	The jumpers on the RQDX3 itself seem easy, is there any magic
	on should know about?

We have looked through the manuals, the configuration we are using
is "legal" according to it, but its awful unclear which is not my
usually feeling from DEC manuals, can anyone out there offer some
assistance in this matter?

